ghts** from Translated’s last meeting, you could:\n- Check their **[blog](https://translated.com/blog)** or **[LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/translated/)** for updates.\n- Reach out to their **PR team** or **customer support** for official statements.\n- If you’re an employee or client, review internal communications (e.g., Slack, email summaries).\n\nWould you like help",
